Design and implement Sophia™, the next-generation AI Security Copilot for the QGuard Helix Platform.

Sophia must evolve from a traditional chatbot into a high-fidelity AI Digital Human, delivering an immersive, enterprise-grade experience comparable to or exceeding leading AI assistants demonstrated by Microsoft Copilot, NVIDIA ACE, OpenAI, and Google Gemini.

Sophia should function as a real-time conversational cybersecurity consultant, capable of speaking naturally, expressing emotions, reacting to user interactions, and providing evidence-based guidance using only the authenticated tenant's live data.

The system must be modular, secure, scalable, performant, and production-ready.

Core Vision

Sophia should feel like a real cybersecurity expert sitting beside the user.

She is not merely a chatbot—she is an intelligent digital consultant capable of understanding enterprise cybersecurity operations, explaining complex concepts, guiding migrations, monitoring infrastructure, and assisting executives with strategic decisions.

Her behavior should communicate professionalism, confidence, trustworthiness, and technical expertise.

